{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14407","headline":"从军行 · 戴叔伦","name":"从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫四方志，结发事远游。\n远游历燕蓟，独戍边城陬。\n西风壠水寒，明月关山悠。\n酬恩仗孤剑，十年弊貂裘。\n封侯属何人，磋跎雪盈头。\n老马思故枥，穷鳞忆深流。\n弹铗动深慨，浩歌气横秋。\n报国期努力，功名良见收。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}